group features/gui
note Type a regex in the search field at the left of the top bar and press enter: every line of every indexed file is matched, up to 5000 hits, and the centre switches to the Results tab listing file:line and the line's text. The status bar gives the count. Clicking a hit opens its file in the Listing at that line. A bad regex is refused in the status bar with the parser's last line. The field keeps its text, selected, so typing replaces it.

